{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":212,"count":40,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-1-21\",\"中午\",\"中午\",\"中午\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你中午回家嗎？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhōngwǔ huí jiā ma?","english":"Do you go home at noon?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-23","sourceFront":"家","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"中午呢？你中午回家嗎？","pinyin":"Zhōngwǔ ne? Nǐ zhōngwǔ huí jiā ma?","english":"How about noon? Are you coming back home at noon?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我下午有課，中午不回家。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiàwǔ yǒu kè, zhōngwǔ bù huí jiā.","english":"I have class in the afternoon; I am not coming home at noon.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"中(central) + 午(noon) → the central part of the day, noon."},{"key":"[\"B1L05-1-15\",\"有空\",\"有空\",\"有空\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你週末有空嗎？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhōumò yǒukòng ma?","english":"Are you available this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-15","sourceFront":"有空","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"妳星期六下午有空嗎？我們一起去喝下午茶，怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Nǐ xīngqí liù xiàwǔ yǒukòng ma? Wǒmen yìqǐ qù hē xiàwǔ chá, zěnmeyàng?","english":"Are you available on Saturday afternoon? How about we have afternoon tea together?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想去朋友家玩，可是沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng qù péngyǒu jiā wán, kěshì méi yǒukòng.","english":"I would like to go to my friend’s place, but I don’t have time.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-02","sourceFront":"可是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"有(have) + 空(free time) → having free time means you are free or available."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-08\",\"上网\",\"上網\",\"上网\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我常常在咖啡廳上網、看書。","pinyin":"Wǒ chángcháng zài kāfēitīng shàngwǎng, kànshū.","english":"I often surf the internet and read at the café.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-08","sourceFront":"上網","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我也不知道。我們可以先上網看地圖。","pinyin":"Wǒ yě bù zhīdào. Wǒmen kěyǐ xiān shàngwǎng kàn dìtú.","english":"I don’t know either. We can check the map online first.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很簡單，上網一查就知道了。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǎndān, shàngwǎng yì chá jiù zhīdào le.","english":"It’s very simple. You can know it as soon as you check it online.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"好，我上網查查看。","pinyin":"Hǎo, wǒ shàngwǎng cháchá kàn.","english":"OK, I will do that.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-2-02\",\"条\",\"條\",\"条\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家附近有三條捷運線，一條紅的、一條綠的和一條藍的。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yǒu sān tiáo jiéyùn xiàn, yì tiáo hóng de, yì tiáo lǜ de hé yì tiáo lán de.","english":"There are three MRT routes near my place; the red one, the green one and the blue one.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"元真，妳的這條裙子真好看，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"Yuánzhēn, nǐ de zhè tiáo qúnzi zhēn hǎokàn, wǒ hěn xǐhuān.","english":"Yuanzhen, your skirt is very beautiful; I like it very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳看，這條黃色的褲子不錯吧？","pinyin":"Nǐ kàn, zhè tiáo huángsè de kùzi búcuò ba?","english":"Look! This pair of yellow pants is nice, isn’t it?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很好看。這條藍的也很漂亮，藍色是今年很流行的顏色。","pinyin":"Hěn hǎokàn. Zhè tiáo lán de yě hěn piàoliang, lánsè shì jīnnián hěn liúxíng de yánsè.","english":"It is. This pair of blue pants is beautiful too. Blue is a popular color of this year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩條我都去穿穿看。","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiáo wǒ dōu qù chuānchuān kàn.","english":"I will try both on.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-11\",\"比较\",\"比較\",\"比较\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-3-13\",\"生活\",\"生活\",\"生活\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我在台灣的生活不錯，很喜歡這裡，也有很多好朋友。","pinyin":"Wǒ zài Táiwān de shēnghuó búcuò, hěn xǐhuan zhèlǐ, yě yǒu hěn duō hǎo péngyou.","english":"My life in Taiwan is good; I like it here a lot, and I also have many good friends.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-13","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在外國跟在自己國家的生活一定不太一樣。","pinyin":"Zài wàiguó gēn zài zìjǐ guójiā de shēnghuó yídìng bú tài yíyàng.","english":"Living in a foreign country and living in your own country are definitely not quite the same.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-08","sourceFront":"外國","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到國外生活以前，得先找租房子的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介覺得在台灣生活的費用(生活費)不太高，日本的比較高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請你想像一下，二十年以後，你的生活會怎麼樣？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-15","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上中文課時，老師要我們用中文報告在台灣的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-10","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的家人非常關心我在國外的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-17","sourceFront":"關心","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很多大學生都打過工，因為得自己付生活費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-07","sourceFront":"打工","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為科技越來越進步了，所以生活也變得更便利了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-20","sourceFront":"科技","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒有人會永遠活著，所以我們每天都要開開心心地生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-23","sourceFront":"永遠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的理想是找到一份正式的工作，過幸福的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-10","sourceFront":"理想","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了給孩子幸福的生活，很多父母一輩子都努力地工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-11","sourceFront":"輩子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我室友的生活習慣很差，我已經忍耐他很久了，真希望他馬上搬走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-41","sourceFront":"忍耐","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個社區的周圍有山有水，空氣也很好，這樣的生活環境很適合退休的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-07","sourceFront":"周圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔先生很重視生活品質，也很喜歡做家事，所以總是把家裡整理得乾乾淨淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-23","sourceFront":"整理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"軍人用卡車把食物和生活用品送到災區，發給需要的民眾。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-31","sourceFront":"發","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有集合大家的力量，有錢出錢、有力出力，才能幫助災民早一點恢復正常生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-32","sourceFront":"出力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市場為了改善兒童和青少年的生活品質，而增加了球場、游泳池等休閒場所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-14","sourceFront":"場所","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家在大馬路旁，從早到晚噪音不斷，嚴重影響了生活品質，所以決定搬家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-09","sourceFront":"噪音","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區不僅沒有地震、颱風，而且天氣好、空氣新鮮，生活環境安全又舒適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-15","sourceFront":"舒適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少外國人說，臺灣最大的魅力是人們能夠接受不同的文化、語言和想法，所以在臺灣生活非常自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-31","sourceFront":"魅力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市長解決了不少這個城市的生活問題，因此民眾的生活水準也大大提高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-20","sourceFront":"大大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得減少工作，增加有意義的休閒活動，這樣的生活比較充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-21","sourceFront":"減少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳先生有五個孩子，生活費負擔很大","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-24","sourceFront":"負擔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小連跟老闆吵架而離開了公司，為了讓家人能繼續過安定的生活，他正努力地找新工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-05","sourceFront":"安定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"正常的生活作息，對身體和心理健康都很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-18","sourceFront":"作息","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過社群網站，我們可以加入感興趣的社團，讓自己的生活更充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-35","sourceFront":"社群網站","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代各式各樣的科技產品，讓人們的生活更舒適、便利","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都希望自己的孩子有幸福的生活、美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-13","sourceFront":"人人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何先生早就習慣了單身生活，一點都不想結婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-25","sourceFront":"單身","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都渴望浪漫的愛情和幸福的家庭，不過自由自在的單身生活也是不錯的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-29","sourceFront":"愛情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個美國人每天看臺灣的連續劇，一方面學習中文，一方面了解臺灣的生活文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-26","sourceFront":"一方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLe