"sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他因為生活條件的限制，而放棄了出國留學的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-04","sourceFront":"放棄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著電子產業發展，人們的生活習慣也受到很深的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-06","sourceFront":"產業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們週末常去鄉下走走，享受農村生活，黃昏時才回市區。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-49","sourceFront":"黃昏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的小學教導孩子從平常生活中學習遵守規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-10","sourceFront":"遵守","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人生活忙碌，就算是好友也偶然才碰面聊聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-24","sourceFront":"偶然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Being born (生) and existing (活) is life."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-07\",\"離\",\"離\",\"离\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家新的百貨公司離這裡遠嗎？","pinyin":"Nà jiā xīn de bǎihuò gōngsī lí zhèlǐ yuǎn ma?","english":"Is that new department store far from here?","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-07","sourceFront":"離","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"王先生家離公司不遠，所以他總是走路去上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-02","sourceFront":"總是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很勇敢，十五歲就離開父母，一個人到英國去留學了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-07","sourceFront":"離開","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說小張離過三次婚，你想他還會再結婚嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-31","sourceFront":"離婚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小龍受不了在那個又熱又髒的工廠工作，只做了三天就離開了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-27","sourceFront":"受不了","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說經理後天就要離開公司了。 這個消息太突然了，大家一時沒辦法接受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-04","sourceFront":"突然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從這裡走路回家有一點兒距離，而且現在還下著大雨，我們還是搭計程車算了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-31","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為天氣太熱了，有一隻貓在車子底下休息，不肯離開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-17","sourceFront":"底下","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐受不了離婚的刺激，已經好幾天吃不好、睡不好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-18","sourceFront":"刺激","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟大樓發生火災時，還好安全人員很冷靜，才能帶著大家安全地離開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-15","sourceFront":"冷靜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥的想法很不實際，他一直想找一份錢多、事少、離家近的工作，但這種工作很難找啊！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-16","sourceFront":"實際","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小游經常喝了酒還開車回家，太太警告他如果不改掉這個壞習慣，就要跟他離婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-20","sourceFront":"警告","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小連跟老闆吵架而離開了公司，為了讓家人能繼續過安定的生活，他正努力地找新工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-05","sourceFront":"安定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有個騙子吃完了麵，假裝忘記帶錢包，騙老闆要回家拿錢，一離開就沒回來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-06","sourceFront":"假裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都喜歡薪水高、離家近、輕鬆的工作，不過這往往只是一個夢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-29","sourceFront":"薪水","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從有了高速鐵路，不僅縮短了交通時間，人與人之間的距離也變近了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-22","sourceFront":"高速","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:聽說小金離婚了，你知道是怎麼回事嗎？ B:唉，這件事說起來都要怪小金，誰教他愛上了別的女生呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-29","sourceFront":"說起來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老先生年輕時就離開了家鄉，他很想回老家去看看親人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-29","sourceFront":"家鄉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看電影時，如果要暫時離開座位，記得把重要物品帶在身上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-09","sourceFront":"物品","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李離婚後才知道失去老婆很痛苦，不過後悔也來不及了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-45","sourceFront":"後悔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"離我家不遠的劇院，是請著名設計師來設計的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-02","sourceFront":"劇院","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方距離公司很近，省了很多時間與交通費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-27","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟房子空間小，位置離市區又遠，所以價值三百萬而已。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-24","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 离(rare beast) takes a 隹(bird) leap → flying away from: 離(away from)."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-13\",\"中部\",\"中部\",\"中部\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從中部坐車到南部去，差不多要兩個小時。","pinyin":"Cóng zhōngbù zuò chē dào nánbù qù, chàbuduō yào liǎng gè xiǎoshí.","english":"Taking a bus from the central part to the southern part takes about two hours.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-13","sourceFront":"中部","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"氣象預報說，從明天起一連三天，中部以北地氣溫只有十五度，出門時最好加件外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-34","sourceFront":"氣溫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"中(central) + 部(part) → the central part."},{"key":"[\"B2L12-2-16\",\"加強\",\"加強\",\"加强\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要是你想出國留學，一定得加強外語能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-16","sourceFront":"加強","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"球員的表現讓教練不斷搖頭，並表示得加強平常的訓練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-31","sourceFront":"搖頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-23\",\"角色\",\"角色\",\"角色\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-25","sourceFront":"多麼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天藝術系的學生要在學校的禮堂，演出跟十二生肖有關的故事。 那名演員很厲害，在那部電影裡一個人演出三個角色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-20","sourceFront":"演出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人信上帝，有人不信。但在東西方的文化中，「上帝」的角色都是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-23","sourceFront":"上帝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他為了演好健身教練的角色，透過運動與調整飲食，讓身體維持在最佳的狀態。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-18","sourceFront":"狀態","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人的想法會隨著身分、角色的不同而改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-18","sourceFront":"身分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個角色一直找不到合適的演員，幸好那位明星點頭答應演出，否則影片就拍不成了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-31","sourceFront":"點頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 角(angle) and 色(color): 角色 means role."},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-39\",\"市长\",\"市長\",\"市长\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"市長解決了不少這個城市的生活問題，因此民眾的生活水準也大大提高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-20","sourceFront":"大大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了使市區（shìqū， urban area）的交通更便利，目前黃市長正進行各種改善計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-17","sourceFront":"目前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這幾年由於市長積極實行交通建設計畫，使當地交通情況明顯改善了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-24","sourceFront":"明顯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市長宣布明天因為颱風的風雨太大，不上班、不上課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-02","sourceFront":"宣布","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-23\",\"情侶\",\"情侶\",\"情侣\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那對情侶因為不了解而在一起，沒想到最後因為了解而分開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-36","sourceFront":"分開","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"情侶之間如果無法相信彼此，很容易就分手了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-16","sourceFront":"彼此","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Two lovers bound by tender 情(feeling) traveling as a devoted 侶(companion) pair: 情侶 means couple."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-07\",\"充實\",\"充實\",\"充实\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我覺得減少工作，增加有意義的休閒活動，這樣的生活比較充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-21","sourceFront":"減少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過社群網站，我們可以加入感興趣的社團，讓自己的生活更充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-35","sourceFront":"社群網站","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想當年，出國留學的日子雖然很忙，卻很充實","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-17","sourceFront":"日子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人的一生只有短短幾十年，應該把握時間，讓生活過得充實、 快樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-30","sourceFront":"一生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著科技進步，醫學也不斷前進，當醫師的人得多充實自己。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-41","sourceFront":"醫學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 充(fill) and 實(real): 充實 means full, enriched."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-14\",\"話題\",\"話題\",\"话题\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有人說，男人的話題常跟政治有關，女人的話題不是名牌包、就是化妝品。你同意嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-14","sourceFront":"話題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 話(speech) and 題(forehead): 話題 means topic."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-22\",\"教材\",\"教材\",\"教材\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個學期中文課的新教材是時代華語第三冊，一共有十六課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-22","sourceFront":"教材","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個教材比較難，老師怕學生不容易吸收，因此利用各種教學工具來幫助學生學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-03","sourceFront":"因此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這本中文教材是網路書店出版的，你得上網才買得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-04","sourceFront":"出版","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"To 教(education) a 材(timber): 教材 means teaching material."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-2-01\",\"尤其\",\"尤其\",\"尤其\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個地區的交通非常混亂，尤其是車多人多的上下班時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-17","sourceFront":"混亂","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很喜歡買文具，尤其是筆，各國進口的原子筆他都有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-22","sourceFront":"原子筆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 尤(especially) and 其(his): 尤其 means especially."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-06\",\"假裝\",\"假裝\",\"假装\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有個騙子吃完了麵，假裝忘記帶錢包，騙老闆要回家拿錢，一離開就沒回來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-06","sourceFront":"假裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"林阿姨來我家推銷保險，我不好意思當面拒絕她，只好假裝有急事要出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-16","sourceFront":"當面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"Putting on a 假(false) persona and deceptive 裝(dress) disguise: 假裝 means pretend."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-20\",\"这下子\",\"這下子\",\"这下子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我沒趕上最後一班公車，這下子只好搭計程車回家了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:我太糊塗了，忘了把變更後的網路銀行密碼記下來。 B:這下子你得親自去銀行處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-26","sourceFront":"變更","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-35\",\"織\",\"織\",\"织\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"母親為家人親手織了幾件毛衣，希望讓大家過個溫暖的冬天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-35","sourceFront":"織","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我想加入社會服務組織，幫助別人的同時也讓自己成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-06","sourceFront":"組織","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生日時，老婆親手織了一頂帽子送我，讓我好感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-16","sourceFront":"頂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在機構、組織擔任的職位越高，代表個人所負擔的責任越重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-22","sourceFront":"職位","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Threading colored 糹(silk) fibers according to a plotted 戠(pattern) enables the artisan to 織(weave) tapestries."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-33\",\"導遊\",\"導遊\",\"导游\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"導遊忘了跟小湯約好在紅毛城門口見面，害他白（白）等了一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-11","sourceFront":"白白","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"旅行團的行程及路線是公司及導遊決定的，不喜歡的話，就只能自助旅遊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-15","sourceFront":"路線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 導(direct) and 遊(sto wander): 導遊 means tour guide."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-39\",\"感情\",\"感情\",\"感情\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"人與人之間的感情很珍貴，就算擁有再多的錢也買不到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-39","sourceFront":"感情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我姑姑跟姑丈結婚已經有二十年了，感情一直很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-03","sourceFront":"姑丈","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過兩段不幸的感情生活，那位女士對愛情已失去了信心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-02","sourceFront":"女士","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸福的婚姻不僅需要觀念的溝通，更需要感情的交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-45","sourceFront":"婚姻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他與妻子雖然已結婚多年，感情仍維持得很好，真令人羨慕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-21","sourceFront":"妻子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次活動是公司主辦的，目的是為了增加同事之間的感情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-26","sourceFront":"主辦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-2-19\",\"信用\",\"信用\",\"信用\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"答應別人的事就要做到，這才是有信用的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-19","sourceFront":"信用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"刷卡購物時，店員會先確認你的簽名是不是和信用卡上的相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-12","sourceFront":"確認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我的錢包丟了，裡面有護照、 信用卡，這件事很要緊，得馬上告訴警察","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-17","sourceFront":"要緊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"付錢的時候，他從皮包裡抽出一張信用卡交給店員","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他昨天去逛夜市的時候，信用卡被偷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-19","sourceFront":"信用卡","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"刷卡買東西很方便，用讀卡機器刷一下信用卡就能付錢了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-08","sourceFront":"刷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"信用卡的正面和背面都有一組號碼，在線上刷卡時用得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-12","sourceFront":"正面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-33\",\"会员\",\"會員\",\"会员\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"如果你是那家網路商店的會員，購買任何商品都可以便宜兩成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-33","sourceFront":"會員","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"如果想入會員並享受我們健身房所提供的服務，請您到櫃臺辦理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-15","sourceFront":"入","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-45\",\"靜\",\"靜\",\"静\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"當周圍環境很靜的時候，可以聽見平常聽不到的聲音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-45","sourceFront":"靜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"心裡很平靜(peaceful)的人，就算居住在人車又多又吵的市區，仍然覺得自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-36","sourceFront":"市區","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"開會時如果老闆突然變得很安靜，也不表達任何意見時，就表示他生氣了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-21","sourceFront":"表示","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那棟大樓發生火災時，還好安全人員很冷靜，才能帶著大家安全地離開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-15","sourceFront":"冷靜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"陳可欣覺得方靜文變了，可是靜文覺得自己沒變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-01","sourceFront":"變","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"圖書館裡的人都在看書，很安靜。","pinyin":"Túshūguǎn lǐ de rén dōu zài kàn shū, hěn ānjìng.","english":"Everyone in the library is reading, so it is very quiet.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-2-07","sourceFront":"安靜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"開車時萬一發生車禍，千萬要冷靜，以免情況更嚴重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-60","sourceFront":"千萬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每次我受不了工作壓力時，就會到湖邊散步，看到平靜的湖水，心裡就會平靜下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-30","sourceFront":"平靜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在冬天的深夜裡，坐在溫暖的地毯上靜靜地看書是一種享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-14","sourceFront":"地毯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子們好不容易才安靜，別去鬧他們，不然又要開始吵鬧了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-12","sourceFront":"鬧","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"青(qīng) light rests as the 爭(dispute) fades → the room goes 靜(still)."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-22\",\"原子笔\",\"原子筆\",\"原子笔\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他很喜歡買文具，尤其是筆，各國進口的原子筆他都有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-22","sourceFront":"原子筆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-01\",\"指示\",\"指示\",\"指示\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"經理對新產品計畫的指示不太清楚，我們最好去問清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-01","sourceFront":"指示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-2-07\",\"嚴格\",\"嚴格\",\"严格\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了使客戶安心使用，我們公司產品訂了嚴格的生產標準。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-07","sourceFront":"嚴格","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"部分大學科系對學生成績的要求非常高，畢業條件也較嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-14","sourceFront":"科系","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3},{"chinese":"為了安全起見，颱風天到山區露營的行為是被嚴格禁止的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-19","sourceFront":"起見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳統私立高中有許多規定，在管理學生方面相當嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-10","sourceFront":"私立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項規定是由大會成員一起討論後決定的，必須嚴格遵守。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-19","sourceFront":"大會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-11\",\"耐用\",\"耐用\",\"耐用\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"很多人購物不在乎商品的品牌，只要耐用就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-11","sourceFront":"耐用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-20\",\"晕\",\"暈\",\"晕\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要是病人頭很暈又有發燒症狀時，就必須立刻送醫院檢查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-20","sourceFront":"暈","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-04\",\"起點\",\"起點\",\"起点\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"跑步比賽的起點跟終點之間都有人協助，避免參加比賽的人發生狀況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-05","sourceFront":"終點","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-23\",\"出\",\"出\",\"出\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"越南也有十二生肖，可是我們沒有兔年，有貓年。我是貓年出生的，屬貓。","pinyin":"Yuènán yě yǒu shí'èr shēngxiào, kěshì wǒmen méi yǒu tù nián, yǒu māo nián. Wǒ shì māo nián chūshēng de, shǔ māo.","english":"There are also zodiac signs in Vietnam, but we don’t have the year of the Rabbit; we have the year of the Cat. I was born in the year of the Cat, which means my zodiac animal sign is cat.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 屮(sprout) takes root in a 凵(container) → growing out through the 出(exit)."},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-15\",\"黃豆\",\"黃豆\",\"黄豆\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"奶奶在後院不只種了綠豆及黃豆，還種了許多蔬菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-15","sourceFront":"黃豆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"不滿\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Clearly 不(not) possessing 滿(full): 不滿 means dissatisfy, dissatisfied."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"似乎\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 似(resembling) and 乎(interrogative or exclamatory final particle): 似乎 means seemingly."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"往\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 彳(step) takes the 主(master) path → walking 往(towards) the gate."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"筆記\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 筆(pen) and 記(record): 筆記 means notes."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"膀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The strong ⺼(meat) muscle on the 旁(side) of your neck forms the 膀(shoulder)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"讀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) at a 賣(sell) stall recites lessons → 讀(study)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"銀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 金(gold) miner pries a 艮(blunt) rock apart → 銀(silver)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"門\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Two tall panels swing apart on hinges to reveal a 門(door)."}]}
